# scripts/databricks_sync.py uploads notebook sources to Databricks
# byte-for-byte and compares them byte-for-byte, so git must not rewrite line
# endings in either direction. Three notebooks in the workspace really do use
# CRLF (00_create_schema_and_common_helpers, 00_specs_hyundai_vinfast_sales,
# 03_hyundai_extract_sales); with `eol=lf` a checkout would silently convert them
# and `diff` would report phantom drift on every one.
* -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
